<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-ENGLAND VS NZ FINAL SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND VS NZ FINAL SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the fifth day of</p>
<p>the first cricket test between England and New Zealand at Eden</p>
<p>Park on Tuesday.</p>
<p>New Zealand first innings 390</p>
<p>England first innings 521</p>
<p>New Zealand second innings (overnight 56 for three)</p>
<p>    B Pocock lbw b Gough		 20</p>
<p>    B Young c Hussain b Cork	    3</p>
<p>    A Parore st Stewart b Tufnell    33</p>
<p>    S Fleming c Crawley b Tufnell     9</p>
<p>    L Germon run out		     13</p>
<p>    N Astle not out		     102</p>
<p>    J Vaughan lbw b Tufnell	     2</p>
<p>    C Cairns b Mullally		   7</p>
<p>    D Patel lbw b Mullally		0</p>
<p>    S Doull b Gough			26</p>
<p>    D Morrison not out		   14</p>
<p>    Extras (nb-8 lb-11)		  19</p>
<p>    Total (for nine wickets)	  248</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-17 2-28 3-47 4-88 5-90 6-92 7-101 8-105</p>
<p>9-142</p>
<p>Bowling: Cork 16-3-45-1 (nb-1), Mullally 26-11-47-2 (nb-1),</p>
<p>White 10-2-26-0 (nb-1), Gough 22-3-66-2 (nb-4), Tufnell</p>
<p>40-18-53-3 (nb-1)</p>
<p>Result: Match drawn.</p>
